      "title": "The manifest builder's place-existing-hypothesis control offers on every reading but a released version",
      "summary": "version-manifest-screen.tsx and use-manifest-builder.ts stop gating PlaceExistingHypothesisControl and its candidate list to the \"ready\" phase, so the control and the case's own unplaced hypotheses are offered on the loading, load-error and not-valid readings too, and the not-valid statement now names the version rather than reusing case-keyed wording.",
